      "content": "i feel like i've ruined everything. i worked so hard to keep everything together, to be the one everyone could rely on, and then i just... i blew it. the scholarship is gone and i don't even know how to look my parents in the eye. i feel like a complete fraud. i can't go home. i just can't face them knowing i'm not who they thought i was.",
