      "content": "it's not that simple. you talk about \"inherent worth\" but in my world, and in my family, worth is what you do. if i'm not the success, i'm nothing. i just keep thinking about how they see me... this version of me that is just a hollow shell of what they expected. i feel like i'm just a stain on everything they've worked for. i'd rather they remember me as the person who succeeded than the person who lived to become this constant, walking disappointment.",
